    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "why",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 44,
      "text": "The isolating mask means option i sees only (state, question, option i).\nSo the prefix read is a genuinely second channel — not a reshape of the first.",
